  - user journey
  - interaction design
  - counterfactual analysis
abstract: >-
  UXYS is an intent-first UX analysis skill for AI agents. It models interfaces as
  networks of user intents, evidence, shortest sufficient routes, friction, and
  destinations, then evaluates block utility and interference across routes.
